          "distinct": true,
          "id": "7b10cc30bec06883d80b52bb3e80886621d1d5f0",
          "message": "feat(deploy): Helm chart for sq-0d744 [SONNET] (#2319)\n\n* feat(deploy): Helm chart for k8s deployment (sq-0d744) [SONNET]\n\nImplements bead sq-0d744 (cloud-deploy epic sq-3vjdr §3.5): a production-ready\nHelm chart for deploying sparq-server and sparq-lws-core to Kubernetes, with\nall secure-defaults from the design record enforced at the template layer.\n\n- deploy/helm/sparq/: Chart.yaml, values.yaml, templates/ (deployment, service,\n  ingress, serviceaccount, pvc, secret-ref, _helpers.tpl, NOTES.txt)\n- deploy/helm/quickstart/sparq-server-quickstart.yaml: plain-manifest no-Helm path\n- deploy/helm/README.md: operator guide + secure-defaults table\n- .github/workflows/deploy-lint.yml: helm lint + template + R4 secret hygiene check\n\nSecure-defaults enforced (R1/R2/R4/R5/R7/R8):\n  R1: auth.existingSecret required for sparq-server; chart fail-fast at render time\n  R4: SPARQ_AUTH_TOKEN from secretKeyRef, never inlined in values.yaml\n  R7: per-server health paths (/health vs /livez+/readyz) via _helpers.tpl\n  R8: readOnlyRootFilesystem, runAsNonRoot, no privilege escalation, caps dropped\n  R5: ServiceAccount with automountServiceAccountToken: false\n\nLWS values marked \"activates once sq-lmz40 ships\" (image not yet published).\nhelm lint + helm template locally verified. deploy-lint.yml is NON-gating to\nci-summary (Rust gate). Workflow: workflow_dispatch + paths: deploy/**.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(deploy): harden Helm chart after IaC review [GPT-5.6]\n\nCo-Authored-By: GPT-5.6 <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* ci(deploy): mark Helm deploy-lint job advisory so it can't fail the merge queue [OPUS-4.8]\n\nThe helm-validate job (helm lint/render/kubeconform) triggers on push/PR only\n(path-filtered to deploy/**), NOT merge_group — so in the merge queue its\nGATING-classified check 'Helm lint, render, and schema validation' is MISSING,\nand ci-summary counts the missing check as a failure. That bounced #2319 from\nthe queue despite every real leg passing. It was gating only because the job\nname lacked the 'advisory' token; add it (matching deploy-terraform-lint) and\nregister it, so ci-summary excludes it. Still runs on PRs for visibility.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-5.6 <noreply@openai.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
